   'A washing cup made of durable quality bamboo, decorated with an illustration of Jerusalem’s Old City in calm blue and beige tones, with raised “Netilat Yadayim” lettering. The two wide handles give a stable, comfortable grip. A perfect blend of tradition, beauty and practicality for any Jewish home.',
