   'An elegant 13 cm acrylic washing cup in a luxurious black and gold design, printed with “Netilat Yadayim”. A modern design combining elegance and function, perfect for any sink. Durable, easy to clean, and it upgrades the hand-washing experience. A perfect gift!',
