   'Un keli de mayim aharonim en acrylique transparent de qualité, avec des paillettes argentées qui font briller la table de Chabbat. Deux anses chromées et un large fond qui recueille l’eau.',
   'A mayim acharonim set in quality clear acrylic with silver sparkles that make the Shabbat table shine. Two elegant chrome handles and a roomy base that collects the water.',
   200, array['/products/art/uk42932-1.webp','/products/art/uk42932-2.webp','/products/art/uk42932-3.webp','/products/art/uk42932-4.webp']::text[], false, true, 'item', 2103),  -- 79.99 × 2.5
